  "body": "Viewing by appointment only.\r\n\r\nWhether you're seeking a stair-free downsizer, an entry-level home into Millwater, or a quiet lock-and-leave, 3A Blake Greens delivers the perfect combination of durability, comfort, and effortless living. Built with solid tilt-slab concrete, this ground-floor home offers acoustic privacy, structural integrity, and year-round peace of mind.\r\n\r\nYear-Round Comfort & Accessibility:\r\n\r\n• Warm & Efficient: Equipped with double glazing throughout and a high-wall heat pump for effortless seasonal climate control.\r\n\r\n• Accessible Bathroom: Designed with a convenient, step-free walk-in tiled shower (no bathtub to navigate).\r\n\r\n• Ground-Floor Ease: Level access with zero stairs - ideal for long-term comfort and easy mobility.\r\n\r\nThoughtful Owner Upgrades:\r\n\r\nImpeccably maintained by its original owner since its completion by Horncastle Homes:\r\n\r\n• Showroom-Style Kitchen: Enhanced with upgraded cabinetry, a custom island bench, and an enlarged cavity to fit a modern full-sized fridge/freezer.\r\n\r\n• Fresh Interiors: Brand-new carpet through the main living area.\r\n\r\n• Two Private Outdoor Spaces: Living area connects to a sunny front patio plus a private, secure rear courtyard.\r\n\r\nKey Highlights & Functionality:\r\n\r\n• Tilt-Slab Concrete Construction: Superior sound insulation from neighbouring units and ultra-low exterior maintenance.\r\n\r\n• Rare Dual Parking: Single internal-access garage plus a second dedicated off-street park.\r\n\r\n• Storage Solutions: Generous internal storage cupboards plus built-in wardrobes in both double bedrooms.\r\n\r\nUnbeatable Millwater Location\r\n\r\nWalk to local cafes, shops, parks, and walking trails. Positioned just minutes from Orewa Beach, Silverdale Retail Centre, and SH1 motorway ramps, and in zone for Silverdale School and Orewa College.\r\n\r\nCall us today to arrange a private viewing.",
